    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Implemented the shared pagination footer as a full-width bottom bar. It is now flush with the left, right, and bottom window edges, has square corners and a single top divider, and keeps the five page controls centered. The old floating width, rounded pill, translation, side gutters, and shadow are gone. RDR2 and Warband rendered checks measured zero-pixel edge and width gaps, 0px radius, and a centered control group before and after scrolling. First, previous, direct entry, next, last, edge disabling, and input clamping all passed; live settings remained unchanged.",
